TimeStamps should be:
	- received_at: when the request arrived.
	- sent_at: when the work was sent to the technician.
	- started_at: when work began.
	- completed_at: when work was finished.
	- delivered_at: when the finished work was delivered.
	- invoiced_at: when it was billed.
	
Not all, but at least "recived_at" and "sent_at" or "delivered_at" should be there in order to trace the work.
